<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Mental state: Joining the cult-->
  <VAEI_JoinCult.baseInspectLine>精神状态：加入邪教</VAEI_JoinCult.baseInspectLine>
  <!--EN: {0} has succumbed to the void influence.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] has decided to leave and join the cult of the void. You can try to arrest [PAWN_objective] as [PAWN_pronoun] leaves. Otherwise, you may still see [PAWN_objective] next time the cultists decide to attack you.-->
  <VAEI_JoinCult.beginLetter>{0}已屈服于虚空影响。

[PAWN_pronoun]已决定离开并加入虚空邪教。您可以尝试在 [PAWN_pronoun] 离开时逮捕 [PAWN_objective]。否则，下次邪教徒决定攻击你时，你可能仍然会看到 [PAWN_objective]。</VAEI_JoinCult.beginLetter>
  <!--EN: joining the cult-->
  <VAEI_JoinCult.beginLetterLabel>加入邪教</VAEI_JoinCult.beginLetterLabel>
  <!--EN: joining the cult-->
  <VAEI_JoinCult.label>加入邪教</VAEI_JoinCult.label>
  <!--EN: {0} has had a change of heart and is coming back to the colony.-->
  <VAEI_JoinCult.recoveryMessage>{0} 改变了主意，正在返回殖民地。</VAEI_JoinCult.recoveryMessage>
  <!--EN: Mental state: Madness-->
  <VAEI_Madness.baseInspectLine>精神状态：疯狂</VAEI_Madness.baseInspectLine>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has lost the last connection to {PAWN_possessive} former self. {PAWN_possessive} regard for health, family, friendship, and love has been shattered by continuous exposure to the dark, corrupting psychic forces of the void.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} will now enter a severe period of madness for several days as {PAWN_pronoun} struggles with {PAWN_possessive} altered mental state and the grim realization of the deepening nightmare. While there's a chance {PAWN_pronoun} might overcome this crisis and restore {PAWN_possessive} sanity, it's far more likely that {PAWN_pronoun} will be completely inhumanized.-->
  <VAEI_Madness.beginLetter>{PAWN_nameDef} 已失去与 {PAWN_possessive} 之前自己的最后一次连接。 {PAWN_possessive}对健康、家庭、友谊和爱情的重视，因持续接触虚空的黑暗、腐化灵能力量而被粉碎。

{PAWN_pronoun}现在将进入严重的疯狂期，持续数日，因为{PAWN_pronoun}与{PAWN_possessive}改变的精神状态作斗争，并深刻认识到日益加深的严峻现实噩梦。虽然 {PAWN_pronoun} 有可能克服这场危机并恢复 {PAWN_possessive} 理智，但 {PAWN_pronoun} 更有可能完全不人道。</VAEI_Madness.beginLetter>
  <!--EN: Madness-->
  <VAEI_Madness.label>疯狂</VAEI_Madness.label>
  <!--EN: Mental state: Sacrificial-->
  <VAEI_Sacrificial.baseInspectLine>精神状态：牺牲</VAEI_Sacrificial.baseInspectLine>
  <!--EN: sacrificial-->
  <VAEI_Sacrificial.label>牺牲的</VAEI_Sacrificial.label>
  <!--EN: Mental state: Mockery spree-->
  <VAEI_ViciousMockery.baseInspectLine>精神状态：嘲笑狂潮</VAEI_ViciousMockery.baseInspectLine>
  <!--EN: {0} is on an mockery spree.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] will wander around, randomly mocking others.-->
  <VAEI_ViciousMockery.beginLetter>{0} 正在疯狂嘲笑。

[PAWN_pronoun] 会到处闲逛，随机嘲笑他人。</VAEI_ViciousMockery.beginLetter>
  <!--EN: {0} is no longer on an mockery spree.-->
  <VAEI_ViciousMockery.recoveryMessage>{0} 不再进行嘲笑。</VAEI_ViciousMockery.recoveryMessage>
  <!--EN: Mental state: Void Drawing-->
  <VAEI_VoidDrawing.baseInspectLine>精神状态：虚空图画</VAEI_VoidDrawing.baseInspectLine>
  <!--EN: void drawing-->
  <VAEI_VoidDrawing.label>无效绘图</VAEI_VoidDrawing.label>
</LanguageData>
